id: cpc_security_secondary_none
label: CPC SECURITY NONE
package: cpc
description: >
  Disable Co-Processor Communication (CPC) security to reduce memory footprint. This is not  recommended, as the data exchanged between the Primary and Secondary devices will be sent in plain-text
  over the physical link.
category: Services|Co-Processor Communication|Secondary Device
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
provides:
- name: cpc_security_secondary
- name: cpc_security_secondary_none
root_path: cpc
